    "DefaultText": "The village keeps to itself. The Miller, Weaver, Apothecary, and Professor stay at home, the Academy, or the Inn instead of travelling or foraging, and the Town Watch has stood down entirely -- none of the four guards take up their posts. Reduces simulation overhead, at the cost of the Watch's crime-and-pursuit content and the villagers' wandering and forage behavior. Recommended on lower-end systems."
